// Ch8 B13 "What Asha hears; the stranger on the wall" (act1_ch08.md §2 B13; W13 → W14). In-engine,
// between Wave 2 and Wave 3.
// W13: in the lull Asha has stopped with her hands half-raised, healing nobody. She is a hearer: with
// the sea in the low town she can hear its lamps going out, one by one. Toma doesn't look away from the
// stair. Then one small boy has stopped dead at the stair-head and won't take the last step. Asha
// kneels and HUMS to him (the Velamir lullaby, the first verse's tune). Humming is not a verse (rule 5:
// her singing never brings the storm; the storm is already here). He climbs. Rhen hears his father's
// tune at the top of a stair in a storm and doesn't know why it stops his breath. Do not surface: Imra
// hummed the same tune to the children on this stair in 1001 (ADR 0022 (a)); Ch17 pays it.
// W14: out on the OUTER parapet, in the spray, a very tall figure where nobody should be able to stand:
// a Kirru, long-necked, crest flat in the wind. He opens his throat and makes the storm's own note
// (pell_storm_note, a voice doing a storm, diegetic), and the spawn on the wall face turn their heads to
// him like dogs to a whistle. PELL SAYS NOTHING IN CH8 (his first words are Ch9's). Sets ch08_pell_seen.
title: ch08_stranger_on_wall
location: ch08/corrow
---
@camera W13
@music seawall_hold
@anim asha hands_half_raised
@wait 1.5
Asha [afraid]: They're going out. Toma. They're going out— #line:ch08_stranger_001
Toma [determined]: I know. Stay on my shield. #line:ch08_stranger_002
@wait 1.0
@camera W13_boy
@mark boy boy_stair_top walk via=way_stair_head_w
@wait 1.0
@mark asha boy_kneel walk
@anim asha kneel_hum boy
@sfx asha_hum_lullaby
@wait 3.0
@mark boy boy_climbed walk via=way_approach_top,way_approach_foot
@anim rhen look_at asha
@face rhen surprised 0.4
@wait 1.5
@camera W14
@sfx pell_storm_note at=pell
@anim pell storm_call
@wait 2.5
Rhen [surprised]: Is he— is he singing to them? #line:ch08_stranger_003
Asha [neutral]: No. He's sounding like it. #line:ch08_stranger_004
<<set $ch08_pell_seen = true>>
@wait 0.5
===
